{"strongs": "H2439", "word": "חוּשׁ", "translit": "chish", "root": "חוש", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "haste, make haste", "definition": "I. חוּשׁ verb haste, make haste (Assyrian —âšu, Dl Pr 180 , Ethiopic ; on this verb V. Nö ZMG 1883, 538 ) — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular חָשׁ Deut 32:35 (or Participle , but see Di ), 1 singular חַשְׁתִּי Ps 119:60 Imperfect 3 feminine singular וַתַּ֫חַשׁ (sic!) Job 31:5 Ges «GKC:72»§ 72 R. 9; Imperative חוּ֫שָׁה 1Sam 20:38 + 6 t. Psalms, + Ps 71:12 Qr ( Kt חישׁה ); Infinitive suffix חוּשִׁי Job 20:2 Participle active חָשׁ Hab 1:8 + Isa 8:1 ; Isa 8:3 in proper name; passive חֻשִׁיּם Num 32:17 but see below: — make haste Deut 32:35 (|| קרוב ), Ps 119:60 in prophetic proper name מַהֵר שָׁלָל חָשׁ בַּז֑ Isa 8:1 ; Isa 8:3 of eagle (in simile of Chald. army) נשׁר חשׁ לאכול Hab 1:8 ; Job 31:5 subject רנל , followed by עלמֿרמה ; חוּ֫שִׁי בּי Job 20:2 my haste in me , i.e. my inward excitement — especially Imperative 1Sam 20:38 (|| מהרה ), and in Psalms: followed by לְעַזְרָתִי 1Sam 22:20 ; 1Sam 38:23 ; 1Sam 40:14 ; 1Sam 70:2 ; 1Sam 71:12 ( Qr ); followed by לִי 1Sam 70:6 ; 1Sam 141:1 passive participle נֵחָלֵץ חֻשִׁים Num 32:17 , but probably for חֲמֻשִׁים ( Kn Di compare Exod 13:18 etc.); Ba NB 180 retains חוּשִׁים and regards it as active (intransitive) = hastening . Hiph`il Perfect הֵחִישׁוּ Judg 20:27 Imperfect יָחִישׁ Isa 28:16 יָחִ֫ישָׁה coh. Isa 5:19 ( Ges «GKC:48»§ 48 . 3); אָחִ֫ישָׁה coh. Ps 55:9 suffix אֲחִישֶׁנָּה Isa 60:22 — 1. shew haste, act quickly Judg 20:37 hasten, come quickly Isa 5:19 (subject מַעֲשֵׂהוּ , || יְמַהֵר ; others: let him hasten on his work ), יָחִישׁ Isa 28:16 hasten away (flee), or hasten about distractedly (si vera lectio; Che Guthe read ימישׁ yield, give way ). 2. transitive with suffix Isa 60:22 I will hasten it ; with accusative Ps 55:9 I would hasten (= secure quickly) my escape.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2650')\">BDB2650</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2363')\">H2363</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H2439')\">H2439</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2649')\">BDB2649</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2651')\">BDB2651</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>חוּשׁ</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>haste, make haste</highlightword> (Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>—âšu,</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>Pr 180</sup></lookup>, Ethiopic <placeholder1694/>; on this verb V. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Nö')\">Nö<sup>ZMG 1883, 538</sup></lookup>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>חָשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:35\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,35)\">Deut 32:35</ref> (or <highlight>Participle</highlight>, but see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup>), 1 singular <bdbheb>חַשְׁתִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 119:60\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"60\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"60\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,60)\">Ps 119:60</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 feminine singular <bdbheb>וַתַּ֫חַשׁ</bdbheb> (sic!) <ref ref=\"Job 31:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,5)\">Job 31:5</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:72»§ 72</sup> R. 9; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>חוּ֫שָׁה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 20:38\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(9,20,38)\">1Sam 20:38</ref> + 6 t. Psalms, + <ref ref=\"Ps 71:12\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,12)\">Ps 71:12</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>חישׁה</bdbheb>); <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> suffix <bdbheb>חוּשִׁי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 20:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,2)\">Job 20:2</ref> <highlight>Participle active</highlight> <bdbheb>חָשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hab 1:8\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,8)\">Hab 1:8</ref> + <ref ref=\"Isa 8:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,1)\">Isa 8:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 8:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,3)\">Isa 8:3</ref> in proper name; <highlight>passive</highlight> <bdbheb>חֻשִׁיּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 32:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,32,17)\">Num 32:17</ref> but see below: — <highlight>make haste</highlight> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:35\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,35)\">Deut 32:35</ref> (|| <bdbheb>קרוב</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 119:60\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"119\" vBegin=\"60\" cEnd=\"119\" vEnd=\"60\" onclick=\"bcv(19,119,60)\">Ps 119:60</ref> in prophetic proper name <bdbheb>מַהֵר שָׁלָל חָשׁ בַּז֑</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 8:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,1)\">Isa 8:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 8:3\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(23,8,3)\">Isa 8:3</ref> of eagle (in simile of Chald. army) <bdbheb>נשׁר חשׁ לאכול</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hab 1:8\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,8)\">Hab 1:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 31:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,5)\">Job 31:5</ref> subject <bdbheb>רנל</bdbheb>, followed by <bdbheb>עלמֿרמה</bdbheb>; <bdbheb>חוּ֫שִׁי בּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 20:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,2)\">Job 20:2</ref> <highlight>my haste in me</highlight>, i.e. my inward excitement — especially <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <ref ref=\"1Sam 20:38\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(9,20,38)\">1Sam 20:38</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מהרה</bdbheb>), and in Psalms: followed by <bdbheb>לְעַזְרָתִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 22:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,22,20)\">1Sam 22:20</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"1Sam 38:23\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(9,38,23)\">1Sam 38:23</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"1Sam 40:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,40,14)\">1Sam 40:14</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"1Sam 70:2\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"70\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"70\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(9,70,2)\">1Sam 70:2</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"1Sam 71:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,71,12)\">1Sam 71:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup>); followed by <bdbheb>לִי</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"1Sam 70:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"70\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"70\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,70,6)\">1Sam 70:6</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"1Sam 141:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"141\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"141\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,141,1)\">1Sam 141:1</ref> <highlight>passive participle</highlight> <bdbheb>נֵחָלֵץ חֻשִׁים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 32:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,32,17)\">Num 32:17</ref>, but probably for <bdbheb>חֲמֻשִׁים</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kn')\">Kn</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Di')\">Di</lookup> compare <ref ref=\"Exod 13:18\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(2,13,18)\">Exod 13:18</ref> etc.); <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>NB 180 retains</sup></lookup> <bdbheb>חוּשִׁים</bdbheb> and regards it as active (intransitive) = <highlight>hastening</highlight>. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>הֵחִישׁוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:27\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,27)\">Judg 20:27</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>יָחִישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,16)\">Isa 28:16</ref> <bdbheb>יָחִ֫ישָׁה</bdbheb> coh. <ref ref=\"Isa 5:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,19)\">Isa 5:19</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ges')\">Ges</lookup><sup>«GKC:48»§ 48</sup>. 3); <bdbheb>אָחִ֫ישָׁה</bdbheb> coh. <ref ref=\"Ps 55:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,55,9)\">Ps 55:9</ref> <highlight>suffix</highlight> <bdbheb>אֲחִישֶׁנָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 60:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,22)\">Isa 60:22</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>shew haste, act quickly</highlight> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:37\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"37\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"37\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,37)\">Judg 20:37</ref> <highlight>hasten, come quickly</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 5:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,5,19)\">Isa 5:19</ref> (subject <bdbheb>מַעֲשֵׂהוּ</bdbheb>, || <bdbheb>יְמַהֵר</bdbheb>; others: <highlight>let him hasten on his work</highlight>), <bdbheb>יָחִישׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 28:16\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(23,28,16)\">Isa 28:16</ref> <highlight>hasten away</highlight> (flee), or <highlight>hasten about</highlight> distractedly (si vera lectio; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Che')\">Che</lookup> Guthe read <bdbheb>ימישׁ</bdbheb> <highlight>yield, give way</highlight>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> transitive with suffix <ref ref=\"Isa 60:22\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,22)\">Isa 60:22</ref> <highlight>I will hasten it</highlight>; with accusative <ref ref=\"Ps 55:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"9\" oncl